@preamble use("math/ffi")
floor
Returns the largest integer less than or equal to x using exact Aiki numbers.

floor(x)

floor(3.7)     # 3
floor(-2.3)    # -3
===
ceil
Returns the smallest integer greater than or equal to x using exact Aiki numbers.

ceil(x)

ceil(3.2)     # 4
ceil(-2.7)    # -2
===
modulo
Returns the Euclidean remainder of a divided by b. The result is non-negative
for a non-zero divisor.

modulo(a, b)

modulo(10, 3)     # 1
modulo(-10, 3)    # 2
